    <item>
      <title>Projects</title>
      <link>https://imdad132.github.io/my-portfolio/projects/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://imdad132.github.io/my-portfolio/projects/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;ongoing-research-and-analytics-projects&#34;&gt;Ongoing Research and Analytics Projects&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 id=&#34;adapting-to-the-transparent-battlefield-force-structure-evolution-in-ukraines-drone-intensive-intensive-warfare&#34;&gt;Adapting to the ‘Transparent Battlefield’: Force Structure Evolution in Ukraine’s Drone Intensive-Intensive Warfare&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Drawing on extensive quantitative and qualitative data from the Ukrainian battlefield, this study investigates how the increasing use of drones is reshaping military force structures.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 id=&#34;from-assassins-to-artillery-strategic-transformation-of-drone-warfare&#34;&gt;From Assassins to Artillery: Strategic Transformation of Drone Warfare&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Examining two decades of drone use in warfare, this research project traces the evolution of drone warfare and identifies its key developmental phases.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Services</title>
      <link>https://imdad132.github.io/my-portfolio/services/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://imdad132.github.io/my-portfolio/services/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div style=&#34;display:flex; gap:40px; align-items:flex-start; width:100%; padding-right:0;&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;flex:3; text-align:justify;&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I combine domain expertise in geopolitics and security studies with advanced quantitative and qualitative methodologies to identify emerging trends, assess strategic risks, and generate evidence-based insights. Drawing on data from social media platforms, public APIs, surveys, and open-source intelligence (OSINT), I analyze complex security environments in a systematic and rigorous manner.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Through the application of machine learning techniques, statistical modeling, and computational analysis, I can help studying contemporary geopolitical risk assessment, conflict forecasting and early warning analysis, strategic evaluation of emerging military technologies, and evolving forms of warfare, including drone and hybrid operations.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
